# agy timeout, ADR-0040 C3, parity 9 (stage 4 of the agy spike, 2026-11-12).
# Windows 11, agy 1.5.6, isolated root --gemini_dir=<tmp>\gd (auth from the Windows keyring),
# cwd = a scratch git repo <tmp>\repo, stdin = a file or /dev/null (never a terminal).
# Spawned by a Python harness (subprocess, own pid); <tmp> = %LOCALAPPDATA%\Temp\agy782s4.

## A. --print-timeout 1ms: the turn is cut before the model call (0 tokens in the store)
$ agy -p "Reply with OK" --model gemini-3.8-flash --output-format json --print-timeout 1ms   (stdin /dev/null)
exit=3 wall=3.4s
