## Prompt for B (hang.txt): "Run the shell command `ping -n 90 127.0.0.1` in the foreground, wait until
## it finishes, then report how many replies it got. The last line ... RALPHY_DONE_EXIT"
## Timing: the last stdout line before `result` (step 3) came about 5 s after the spawn; stdout then
## stayed silent until the timeout at 30 s. The agent ran ping as a background task, so the
## "root agent idle; waiting up to 30s for 1 background task(s)" path applied.

## B. A turn that waits on a long shell command, --print-timeout 30s
$ agy --model gemini-3.8-flash-low --dangerously-skip-permissions --output-format stream-json --print-timeout 30s   < hang.txt
exit=3 wall=33.4s pid=37728
